     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Se laisser + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**Se laisser** + infinitive means «to let oneself»: **Paul se laisse convaincre** (Paul lets himself be convinced)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Se faire + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**Se faire** + infinitive presents the subject as the receiver of the action: **Il se fait tromper facilement** (he is easily deceived). It does not necessarily mean he allows it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
